# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# UCBAZZAR — .gitignore
#
# Site deploy ke liye kaun si files jati hain wo whitelist se decide hota
# hai — Cloudflare Pages ke build command me (GO-LIVE.md Part 1) aur
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml me (index.html, assets/, robots.txt,
# sitemap.xml, _headers, _redirects, .nojekyll). Ye file sirf junk ko repo se
# bahar rakhti hai taki commit history saaf rahe.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# Deploy build ka output (machine par banta hai, repo me nahi jaata)
dist/

# Codebuff / agent tooling (site ka hissa nahi)
.freebuff/

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Logs / temporary
*.log
*.tmp
